<!--
  MLIE_FAUNA_ABSORPTION_1 Wave C — KraytDragon creature port (Pass 14).
  Ported from mlie.starwarsanimalcollection's `KraytDragon` ThingDef/
  PawnKindDef pair (Races_Animal_SW.xml, workshop folder 3497316713),
  renamed under the RSW_ tier prefix. Geometry/stats/comps copied verbatim.
  Distinct species from the ALREADY-PORTED `RSW_GreaterKraytDragon`
  (Pass 12) — the donor ships both as separate subspecies, confirmed by
  reading both ThingDefs directly (different body plans, stats, art).

  Body: the donor's custom `KraytDragon` BodyDef needs only its tail
  repointed to the ALREADY-PORTED Wave B `RSW_SW_Spikes` BodyPartDef and
  `RSW_SWTailAttackTool` BodyPartGroupDef (the same tail
  RSW_GreaterKraytDragon already uses) — every other part vanilla Core
  (Head/Skull/Brain/Eye/Nose/AnimalJaw, Leg/Foot/Paw). Ported as
  RSW_KraytDragon (RSW_MlieWaveC_Bodies.xml).

  Resources: `leatherDef` (`Leather_KraytDragon`) and `specificMeatDef`
  (`Krayt_Meat`) BOTH ALREADY EXIST as `RSW_Leather_KraytDragon`/
  `RSW_Krayt_Meat` — ported for GreaterKraytDragon (Pass 12), which shares
  the exact same 2 donor resource defNames, confirmed against both
  species' own ThingDef XML directly, not assumed — no new leather/meat
  needed. 2 new eggs (RSW_EggKraytDragonFertilized/UnFertilized, texPath
  swresource/EggSpiked — ALREADY EXTRACTED, Pass 12, reused unchanged) and
  its own butcher-body-part trophy (RSW_KraytDragonSkull, texPath
  swresource/Trophies/KraytDragonSkull, newly extracted this pass,
  distinct from GreaterKraytDragon's own RSW_KraytPearl trophy). All in
  RSW_MlieWaveC_Resources.xml. The donor's own `KraytDragonHorn` trophy
  (used only by 2 generic crafting recipes, not by this species' own
  butcherBodyPart) is left unported — out of scope, same as the recipe
  system generally.

  Ability: `<race><specialTrainables>` AND PawnKindDef `<abilities>` both
  reference `SW_Calamity`, ALREADY PORTED (Pass 12, `RSW_SW_Calamity`) —
  repointed directly, same dual wiring GreaterKraytDragon/Fambaa/Horax use,
  no new ability port needed.

  🔑 **canCrossBreedWith updated on both sides, not just this file**: the
  donor's own KraytDragon lists `KraytDragon` (itself) and `KellDragon`
  (still unported); ported here as `RSW_KraytDragon`/`KellDragon` (self
  repointed since this species is now ported, KellDragon left bare per
  standing "leave pointing at still-bare donor names" precedent). Also
  fixed the OTHER side of this relationship, flagged for exactly this
  moment by Pass 12's own header comment: `RSW_GreaterKraytDragon.xml`'s
  `canCrossBreedWith` bare `<li>KraytDragon</li>` repointed to
  `<li>RSW_KraytDragon</li>` in the same pass (KellDragon there stays bare,
  still unported).

  No ArtOverride collision — a full `find src/RimStarWars -maxdepth 1
  -iname "*ArtOverride*"` for KraytDragon-named folders found none (only
  `GreaterKraytDragonArtOverride`, a distinct species). All art shipped
  from SWBestiary.

  Art: 12 PNGs extracted this pass via extract_bundle.py against the live
  Steam workshop bundle (workshop folder 3497316713) — KraytDragon_j_south/
  east/north (3), KraytDragon_j_Dessicated (1), KraytDragon_m_south/east/
  north (3, adult male), KraytDragon_f_south/east/north (3, adult female),
  KraytDragon_Dessicated (1), KraytDragonSkull (1) — all confirmed non-zero
  and PIL-openable. The donor's own `KraytDragonHorn` texture (also in the
  bundle) was seen in the inventory listing but deliberately not extracted,
  matching the unported-resource decision above.

  Wired into the live cast this same pass: per cast_assignment.csv's own
  ground truth (ExtremeDesert 0.15, renamed in place from the bare donor
  row).
-->
<Defs>
