    <label>krayt dragon</label>
    <description>Krayt dragons are large, carnivorous reptiles from Tatooine, a desert planet in the galaxy's Outer Rim Territories. They come in two native subspecies and, despite their fierceness, are hunted for the valuable skulls.</description>
